<div class="reading-paths" aria-labelledby="paths-title">
        <div class="paths-heading"><h3 id="paths-title">从哪里开始读？</h3><span>FIND YOUR OWN PATH</span></div>
        <div class="path-grid">
          <dl class="reading-path"><dt><span>01</span> 后端工程，从原理到实践</dt><dd><a href="#book-java">Java 并发</a><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><a href="#book-jvm">JVM 排障</a><br><a href="#book-go-service">Go 服务工程</a>：取消传播、有界并发与资源回收。<br><a href="#book-netty">Netty</a>：异步网络与协议边界。<br><a href="#book-redis">Redis</a>：数据建模与缓存。<br><a href="#book-mysql">MySQL</a><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><a href="#book-mysql-recovery">备份、复制与恢复演练</a>：从事务走向数据保护与故障切换。<br><a href="#book-rocketmq">RocketMQ</a>：消息模型与可靠交付。<br><a href="#book-kafka">Kafka</a><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><a href="#book-cdc-data-pipeline">CDC 数据同步</a>：从日志走向投影、重建与对账。<br><a href="#book-kubernetes">Kubernetes</a><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><a href="#book-kubernetes-operator">控制器与 Operator 工程</a>：从应用部署走向协调循环与可靠运维。<br><a href="#book-envoy">Envoy</a><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><a href="#book-gateway">API 网关</a><br><a href="#book-ai-gateway">AI 网关与模型路由</a>：模型服务接入与资源治理。<br><a href="#book-observability">全链路可观测性</a>：跨组件证据与故障定位。</dd></dl>
          <dl class="reading-path"><dt><span>02</span> Agent 工程，从入门到专题</dt><dd><a href="#book-agent">Agent 工程入门与实战</a>：从知识库助手开始。<br><a href="#book-durable-agent-workflow">长任务 Agent</a>：持久状态、审批与故障恢复。<br><a href="#book-enterprise-agent-auth">企业 Agent 工具接入</a>：身份委托、对象授权与审计。<br><a href="#book-knowledge-retrieval">企业知识库检索</a>：文档、权限与可核查的证据。<br><a href="#book-sandbox">Sandbox</a>：理解执行与隔离边界。<br><a href="#book-memory">Agent 记忆</a>：探索记忆与系统设计。<br><a href="#book-ai-quality">AI 应用质量交付</a>：评测、回归与发布门槛。</dd></dl>
          <dl class="reading-path"><dt><span>03</span> 读懂 AI 编程助手</dt><dd><a href="#book-codex">Codex 工程</a>：代理循环与权限边界。<br><a href="#book-pi">Pi 工程入门</a>：会话、工具与扩展。<br><a href="#book-harness">DeepSeek Harness</a>：任务流程与插件协作。<br><a href="#book-claude-code">Claude Code 源码阅读</a>：启动、对话与工具。<br><a href="#book-agent-harness">AI 编程代理工程</a>：对照四套实现，动手构建 Harness。</dd></dl>
          <dl class="reading-path"><dt><span>04</span> 迈出开源贡献的第一步</dt><dd>从 <a href="#book-opensource">Apache 开源入门</a> 开始：<br>选项目 → 第一个 PR → 持续贡献。</dd></dl>
        </div>
        <p class="reading-note">阅读路线是选读建议，可按兴趣单独阅读。Envoy 还提供 <a href="https://github.com/Aias00/envoy-learning-book/releases/tag/v1.0.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">PDF 等格式</a>。</p>
      </div>
